{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>For the transgression of a land</b> — the common people have many officers to destroy them. And on account of a person of understanding, who knows knowledge, who will turn them back from their transgression, so the people will endure."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:10.040280366Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}